を歌う歌枠ですのじゃー！のじゃー！
...a singing stream where I sing those, nojaa! Nojaa!

20
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:16,250
あのね、今までなんとまだボカロ縛りをわしやったことないんじゃよ。
You know, believe it or not, I've never actually done a Vocaloid-only stream before, noja.

21
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:23,400
初配信から、あの自分がいかにボーカロイドが好きか、いかに合成音声が好きかみたいな。
Ever since my debut stream, I've talked about how much I love Vocaloid and how much I love synthesized voices...

22
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:26,800
うん。普段ボカロしか聴かないからね。
Yeah. Since I normally only listen to Vocaloid.

23
00:04:27,250 --> 00:04:33,950
みたいなの言ってた割に、全然歌枠でボカロ歌わないなって思われてたと思うのじゃ。
Even though I said all that, I think people probably wondered why I barely ever sang Vocaloid in my singing streams, noja.

24
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:41,600
やっぱ最初はね、最初はね、ま、ボカロも歌ったことあるよ。サラマンダーとかも歌枠で歌ったことあるけど、
Well, at first, you know, I mean I've sung Vocaloid before. I've sung Salamander and stuff in singing streams too, but...

25
