95
00:10:31,816 --> 00:10:38,316
やっぱ季節感を出していきたい、VTuberとして。VTuberとして季節感を出していきたいと思い…
As a VTuber, I really want to bring out that seasonal vibe. Thinking I should showcase the season as a VTuber...

96
00:10:38,816 --> 00:10:40,116
よいしょ
There we go.

97
00:10:40,516 --> 00:10:50,516
ハロウィンの曲を歌わせていただきますのじゃ～！Junkyさんの「Happy Halloween」を歌います。歌いますのじゃ。
I'll be singing a Halloween song, no ja~! I'm going to sing Happy Halloween by Junky-san. Yes, I'll sing it, no ja.

98
00:10:51,016 --> 00:10:59,016
それでは、それでは、1曲目歌っていきますのじゃ！よいしょ、よいしょ。
Well then, well then, I'll start singing the first song, no ja! Alright, alright.

99
00:11:00,116 --> 00:11:01,816
歌詞は出るかな？
Will the lyrics show up?

100
00:11:02,016 --> 00:11:03,016
出た！
