騒ぎ出す 小さいオバケたち
The little ghosts start making a fuss

117
00:12:18,116 --> 00:12:22,016
今日は許してくれるの
Today they'll forgive us, won't they?

118
00:12:22,016 --> 00:12:26,016
さあ 街に行こう
Come on, let's head into town!

119
00:12:26,116 --> 00:12:30,016
だって Happy Halloween 悪戯しちゃうぞ ding-dong-dang
Because it's Happy Halloween, I'll play a prank, ding-dong-dang!

120
00:12:30,016 --> 00:12:33,916
あっちもこっちも trick or treat キャンディーはくれないの？
Here and there, trick or treat, won't you give me some candy?

121
00:12:34,116 --> 00:12:38,016
だって Happy Halloween 幼気なランタンパンプキン
