What I want to tell you today is all about you, who are so precious!

483
00:39:05,056 --> 00:39:09,556
たまにはケンカもしてきたけど だからこそ何でも知ってんだ
We've had our fights sometimes, but that's exactly why I know everything about you.

484
00:39:09,656 --> 00:39:14,256
君の長所はマジメなこと ただ妄想癖がひどい！
Your strong point is being earnest, though your delusions are awful!

485
00:39:14,356 --> 00:39:18,656
君が飛び降りるのならば僕は 笑って一緒に飛び降りる
If you were to jump off, I'd smile and jump off right along with you.

486
00:39:18,756 --> 00:39:23,356
止めてくれるとでも思ったか！ 僕らの絆を見くびるか！
Did you think I'd try to stop you? Don't underestimate our bond!

487
00:39:23,456 --> 00:39:27,856
そして手を繋いで落ちて行こう 地面めがけてピースしよう
And let's hold hands as we fall down, flash a peace sign toward the ground!

488
00:39:27,956 --> 00:39:32,456
でもそういえば何かを 忘れているような……
Wait, now that I think about it, feels like I'm forgetting something...

489
