Did you think I could be talked out of it? Don't underestimate my foolishness!

498
00:40:09,047 --> 00:40:13,397
え何？あのマンガの主人公か 今週敵を倒したて
Wait, what? The protagonist from that manga defeated the enemy this week?

499
00:40:13,397 --> 00:40:18,797
って何何回言えば分かるんだ 僕は単行本派なんだ！
How many times do I have to tell you? I only read the compiled volumes!

500
00:40:18,797 --> 00:40:22,497
